# skim_wake.jsc - fly 6 u above the sea (skim band < 8 u), level then banked, night then day.
# Checks (group C): shadow on the sea under the jet that narrows when banked, wake V,
# bioluminescent wake at night, spray; no crash while skimming.
0     persist assist 2
0     tod night
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek sea 6
+1.5  shot skim_level
+0    assert agl < 9
+0    assert crashes == 0
+0.5  tilt 25 0 0.3
+0.8  shot skim_banked
+0.7  tilt 0 0 0.3
+0.5  tod day
+1.0  shot skim_day
+0    assert crashes == 0
+0    sheet skim_wake 3
+0    end
